#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:8359
msgid "Learn more about Wordfence settings here:"
msgstr "Máis información acerca dos axustes de Wordfence aquí:"

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:6295
msgid "Wordfence is not designed to run in a web browser using an environment that simulates a web server stack. Doing this will lead to unpredictable results."
msgstr "Wordfence non está deseñado para executarse nun navegador web mediante un contorno que simule unha pila de servidor web. Facelo producirá resultados imprevisibles."

#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:507 lib/wordfenceClass.php:9010
msgid "Get help completing the setup process."
msgstr "Obtén axuda para completar o proceso de configuración."

#: modules/login-security/views/settings/user-stats.php:69
msgid "View by role"
msgstr "Ver por perfil"

#: modules/login-security/views/settings/user-stats.php:42
msgid "Overview of authentication methods adoption across all users."
msgstr "Resumo da adopción dos métodos de identificación entre todos os usuarios."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/register-disabled.php:28
msgid "Passkeys can only be added by the user themselves."
msgstr "Só o propio usuario pode engadir as súas claves de acceso."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:92
msgid "Use Passkeys Only"
msgstr "Usar só claves de acceso"

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:89
msgid "Before continuing, test your passkey in another browser or incognito window."
msgstr "Antes de continuar, proba a túa clave de acceso noutro navegador ou nunha ventá de incógnito."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:88
msgid "Selecting “Passkeys only” disables username and password sign-in for your account. If you lose access to your passkeys, you may be unable to sign in."
msgstr "Se seleccionas «Só claves de acceso», desactívase o acceso con nome de usuario e contrasinal na túa conta. Se perdes o acceso ás túas claves de acceso, é posible que non poidas acceder."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:86
msgid "Confirm “Passkeys only”"
msgstr "Confirmar «Só claves de acceso»"

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:75
msgid "Cannot be changed because your administrator requires passkey-only sign-in for your role."
msgstr "Non se pode cambiar porque o teu administrador require o acceso só con claves de acceso para o teu perfil."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:73
msgid "Manage settings"
msgstr "Xestionar axustes"

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:73
msgid "Cannot be changed because Passkeys are set to Required for this user’s role."
msgstr "Non se pode cambiar porque as claves de acceso están configuradas como «Obrigatorio» para o perfil deste usuario."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:67
msgid "<strong>Make sure this user has a backup.</strong> If none of their registered passkeys are available or working, they may not be able to sign in. A site administrator will need to restore this user’s access."
msgstr "<strong>Asegúrate de que este usuario ten un método de reserva.</strong> Se ningunha das súas claves de acceso rexistradas está dispoñible ou funciona, é posible que non poida acceder. Un administrador do sitio terá que restaurar o acceso deste usuario."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:65
msgid "<strong>Make sure you have a backup.</strong> If none of your registered passkeys are available or working, you may not be able to sign in. Another administrator will need to restore your access. If you're the only administrator, you could be locked out of the site."
msgstr "<strong>Asegúrate de ter un método de reserva.</strong> Se ningunha das túas claves de acceso rexistradas está dispoñible ou funciona, é posible que non poidas acceder. Outro administrador terá que restaurar o teu acceso. Se es o único administrador, poderías quedar sen acceso ao sitio."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:63
msgid "<strong>Make sure you have a backup.</strong> If none of your registered passkeys are available or working, you may not be able to sign in. A site administrator will need to restore your access."
msgstr "<strong>Asegúrate de ter un método de reserva.</strong> Se ningunha das túas claves de acceso rexistradas está dispoñible ou funciona, é posible que non poidas acceder. Un administrador do sitio terá que restaurar o teu acceso."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:56
msgid "Only registered passkeys can be used to sign in."
msgstr "Só se poden usar claves de acceso rexistradas para acceder."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:55
msgid "Passkeys only"
msgstr "Só claves de acceso"

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:47
msgid "Use your passkey when available, with username and password as a backup."
msgstr "Usa a túa clave de acceso cando estea dispoñible, co nome de usuario e o contrasinal como alternativa."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:44
msgid "Allow username and password if a passkey fails"
msgstr "Permitir nome de usuario e contrasinal se falla a clave de acceso"

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:14
msgid "How can the user log in?"
msgstr "Como pode acceder o usuario?"

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:14
msgid "How do you want to log in?"
msgstr "Como queres acceder?"

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/manage.php:88
#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/register.php:30
msgid "Create a passkey and give it a name so you can identify it later. You may need a separate passkey for each device unless your passkeys sync through a password manager."
msgstr "Crea unha clave de acceso e ponlle un nome para poder identificala máis adiante. Pode que necesites unha clave de acceso distinta para cada dispositivo, salvo que as túas claves de acceso se sincronicen a través dun xestor de contrasinais."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/manage.php:83
#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/register-disabled.php:23
#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/register.php:25
msgid "Add a Passkey"
msgstr "Engadir unha clave de acceso"

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/information.php:30
msgid "<strong>Safer by design</strong> — each passkey is unique to the site, and no reusable secret is sent during sign-in."
msgstr "<strong>Máis segura por deseño</strong>: cada clave de acceso é única para o sitio e non se envía ningún segredo reutilizable durante o acceso."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/information.php:26
msgid "<strong>Fast and easy</strong> — sign in with your fingerprint, face, PIN, or device unlock."
msgstr "<strong>Rápida e sinxela</strong>: accede coa túa pegada dixital, o teu rostro, un PIN ou o desbloqueo do dispositivo."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/information.php:22
msgid "<strong>Phishing-resistant</strong> — passkeys only work with the site they were created for."
msgstr "<strong>Resistente á suplantación de identidade</strong>: as claves de acceso só funcionan co sitio para o que se crearon."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/information.php:15
msgid "Replace passwords with a faster, safer way to sign in."
msgstr "Substitúe os contrasinais por un xeito máis rápido e seguro de acceder."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/grace-period.php:32
msgid "Locked out."
msgstr "Bloqueado."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/active.php:21
#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/manage.php:38
msgid "This is the user's only passkey. If you remove it, the user will return to signing in with a username and password. Removing it here will not remove it from the user's password manager."
msgstr "Esta é a única clave de acceso do usuario. Se a eliminas, o usuario volverá acceder co nome de usuario e o contrasinal. Eliminala aquí non a eliminará do xestor de contrasinais do usuario."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/active.php:20
#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/manage.php:37
msgid "This is your only passkey. If you remove it, you’ll return to signing in with your username and password. Removing it here may not remove it from your device’s password manager."
msgstr "Esta é a túa única clave de acceso. Se a eliminas, volverás acceder co teu nome de usuario e contrasinal. Eliminala aquí pode que non a elimine do xestor de contrasinais do teu dispositivo."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/active.php:17
#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/manage.php:34
msgid "Are you sure you want to remove this passkey? Deleting a passkey here does not necessarily remove it from your device's password manager."
msgstr "Seguro que queres eliminar esta clave de acceso? Eliminar unha clave de acceso aquí non a elimina necesariamente do xestor de contrasinais do teu dispositivo."

#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/active.php:13
#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/manage.php:28
msgid "Your Passkeys"
msgstr "As túas claves de acceso"

#: modules/login-security/views/page/passkey-disabled-admin.php:132
msgid "An error was encountered while trying to enable passkeys. Please try again."
msgstr "Produciuse un erro ao intentar activar as claves de acceso. Téntao de novo."

#: modules/login-security/views/page/passkey-disabled-admin.php:59
