msgstr "O acceso con clave de acceso está desactivado actualmente neste sitio. Consérvanse as claves de acceso existentes e os axustes dos perfís."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/wordfencels.php:1008
#: modules/login-security/views/page/manage-embedded.php:37
#: modules/login-security/views/page/manage.php:46
msgid "Signing in using 2FA is currently disabled for this site. Existing credentials and role settings are preserved."
msgstr "O acceso con 2FA está desactivado actualmente neste sitio. Consérvanse as credenciais existentes e os axustes dos perfís."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/passkey.php:1434
msgid "Unable to restore username/password authentication before registering the first passkey. Please try again."
msgstr "Non se puido restaurar a identificación con nome de usuario e contrasinal antes de rexistrar a primeira clave de acceso. Téntao de novo."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:250
msgid "Used to determine the default passkey credential domain. Usually does not need to be updated manually."
msgstr "Úsase para determinar o dominio de credenciais por defecto das claves de acceso. Normalmente non é necesario actualizalo manualmente."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:247
msgid "When enabled, reCAPTCHA and 2FA prompt support will be added to WooCommerce login and registration forms in addition to the default WordPress forms."
msgstr "Cando está activado, engádese a compatibilidade con reCAPTCHA e coa solicitude de 2FA nos formularios de acceso e rexistro de WooCommerce, ademais de nos formularios por defecto de WordPress."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:246
msgid "When enabled, separate Wordfence Passkeys and Wordfence 2FA entries will be added to the WooCommerce account menu so users can manage their credentials outside of the WordPress admin area."
msgstr "Cando está activado, engádense entradas separadas de Claves de acceso de Wordfence e 2FA de Wordfence ao menú da conta de WooCommerce para que os usuarios poidan xestionar as súas credenciais fóra da área de administración de WordPress."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:243
msgid "Enable 2FA to choose which user roles can use it and configure additional settings."
msgstr "Activa a 2FA para elixir que perfís de usuario poden usala e configurar axustes adicionais."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:234
msgid "Unsaved Changes"
msgstr "Cambios sen gardar"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:230
msgid "Keep Editing"
msgstr "Seguir editando"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:221
msgid "Show Wordfence Passkeys and Wordfence 2FA menus on WooCommerce Account page"
msgstr "Mostrar os menús Claves de acceso de Wordfence e 2FA de Wordfence na páxina da conta de WooCommerce"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:218
msgid "Email users in the selected role to remind them to set up required authentication. Optionally specify the URL to be sent in the email; blank defaults to Wordfence’s Login Security page."
msgstr "Envía un correo electrónico aos usuarios do perfil seleccionado para lembrarlles que configuren a identificación obrigatoria. Opcionalmente, indica o URL que se enviará no correo electrónico; se o deixas en branco, úsase por defecto a páxina de seguridade no acceso de Wordfence."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:215
msgid "Save your changes before switching tabs?"
msgstr "Queres gardar os cambios antes de cambiar de pestana?"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:202
msgid "Roles"
msgstr "Perfís"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:194
msgid "Some customers may have trouble with 2FA. \"Optional\" lets them choose whether to enable it."
msgstr "Algúns clientes poden ter problemas coa 2FA. «Opcional» permítelles elixir se a activan."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:192
msgid "Some customers may have trouble with passkeys. \"Optional\" lets them sign in with a password or passkey."
msgstr "Algúns clientes poden ter problemas coas claves de acceso. «Opcional» permítelles acceder cun contrasinal ou cunha clave de acceso."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:190
msgid "Enable passkeys to choose which user roles can use them and configure additional settings."
msgstr "Activa as claves de acceso para elixir que perfís de usuario poden usalas e configurar axustes adicionais."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:169
msgid "Determines how Wordfence handles authenticator sign-in counters used to detect cloned passkeys."
msgstr "Determina como xestiona Wordfence os contadores de inicios de sesión do autenticador usados para detectar claves de acceso clonadas."

#. translators: Default passkey credential domain.
#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:165
msgid "By default, Wordfence uses this site's main domain (\"%s\")."
msgstr "Por defecto, Wordfence usa o dominio principal deste sitio («%s»)."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:163
msgid "Disabling two-factor authentication will prevent all users from signing in with 2FA. Existing 2FA credentials and role settings will be preserved. Users may sign in using only their username and password without any additional protection."
msgstr "Desactivar a identificación de dous factores impedirá que todos os usuarios accedan con 2FA. Conservaranse as credenciais 2FA existentes e os axustes dos perfís. Os usuarios poderán acceder usando só o seu nome de usuario e contrasinal, sen ningunha protección adicional."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:162
msgid "Disabling passkeys will prevent all users from registering or signing in with passkeys. Existing passkeys and role settings will be preserved. Users may sign in using only their username and password without any additional protection."
msgstr "Desactivar as claves de acceso impedirá que todos os usuarios rexistren claves de acceso ou accedan con elas. Conservaranse as claves de acceso existentes e os axustes dos perfís. Os usuarios poderán acceder usando só o seu nome de usuario e contrasinal, sen ningunha protección adicional."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:161
msgid "Confirm Disabling Two-Factor Authentication"
msgstr "Confirmar a desactivación da identificación de dous factores"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:160
msgid "Confirm Disabling Passkeys"
msgstr "Confirmar a desactivación das claves de acceso"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:159
msgid "Controls which domain passkeys are created for. Enter a hostname here only if you need to use a different credential domain. Most sites should leave this unchanged."
msgstr "Controla para que dominio se crean as claves de acceso. Introduce aquí un hostname só se necesitas usar un dominio de credenciais diferente. A maioría dos sitios deberían deixalo sen cambios."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:158
msgid "One hostname per line. HTTPS uses port 443 by default. Specify other ports explicitly."
msgstr "Un hostname por liña. HTTPS usa o porto 443 por defecto. Indica explicitamente os demais portos."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:153
msgid "Users can use passkeys but still can sign in with their password"
msgstr "Os usuarios poden usar claves de acceso, pero aínda poden acceder co seu contrasinal"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:152
msgid "Users can sign in with their username and password during the grace period only. After it ends, they must use a passkey"
msgstr "Os usuarios poden acceder co seu nome de usuario e contrasinal só durante o período de graza. Cando remate, deberán usar unha clave de acceso"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:151
msgid "Test passkey sign-in for each enabled role to check for plugin or theme conflicts"
msgstr "Proba o acceso con clave de acceso para cada perfil activado para comprobar se hai conflitos con plugins ou temas"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:150
msgid "Required:"
msgstr "Obrigatorio:"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:149
#: modules/login-security/views/passkey/options.php:45
msgid "RECOMMENDED"
msgstr "RECOMENDADO"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:148
msgid "Optional:"
msgstr "Opcional:"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:134
#: modules/login-security/views/page/passkey-disabled-admin.php:35
msgid "Manage Login Security"
msgstr "Xestionar a seguridade no acceso"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:124
msgid "Grace period"
msgstr "Período de graza"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:121
msgid "<strong>Before requiring passkeys:</strong> Make sure users have a backup passkey or another way to access their account"
msgstr "<strong>Antes de requirir claves de acceso:</strong> asegúrate de que os usuarios teñen unha clave de acceso de reserva ou outra forma de acceder á súa conta"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:120
msgid "Give users time to set up required passkeys or 2FA before access is restricted. Admin users must have the grace period manually enabled."
msgstr "Dálles tempo aos usuarios para configurar as claves de acceso ou a 2FA obrigatorias antes de que se restrinxa o acceso. Os usuarios administradores deben ter o período de graza activado manualmente."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:93
#: modules/login-security/views/page/passkey-disabled-admin.php:33
#: modules/login-security/views/page/passkey-disabled-admin.php:69
msgid "Enable Passkeys"
msgstr "Activar as claves de acceso"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:92
#: modules/login-security/views/page/passkey-disabled-admin.php:71
msgid "Enable Now"
msgstr "Activar agora"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:82
msgid "Hostnames allowed to register and use passkeys. Most sites can leave the default values unchanged."
msgstr "Hostnames permitidos para rexistrar e usar claves de acceso. A maioría dos sitios poden deixar os valores por defecto sen cambios."

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/javascript.php:68
