#: lib/menu_support.php:38
msgid "As a Wordfence Premium customer you're entitled to paid support via our ticketing system. Our senior support engineers respond to Premium tickets during regular business hours (Monday to Friday, 6am to 5pm Pacific and 9am to 8pm Eastern time) and have a direct line to our QA and development teams."
msgstr "Como cliente de Wordfence Premium tes dereito a un soporte de pago a través do noso sistema de tíckets. Os nosos enxeñeiros de soporte sénior responden aos tíckets Premium durante o horario de traballo regular (de luns a venres, de 6 a 17 horas (Horario do Pacífico - PST) e de 9 a 20 horas (Horario do Este - ET)) e teñen unha liña directa cos nosos equipos de calidade e desenvolvemento."

#: lib/menu_support.php:36
msgid "As a Wordfence Care customer you are entitled to hands-on priority support and have access to our incident response team. Our senior support engineers and incident response team respond to requests quickly within business hours (Monday to Friday, 6am to 5pm Pacific and 9am to 8pm Eastern time) and can sign-in to your site on request to assist with complex issues."
msgstr "Como cliente de Wordfence Care tes dereito a un soporte práctico e prioritario  e tes acceso ao noso equipo de resposta a incidentes. Os nosos enxeñeiros de soporte sénior e o equipo de resposta a incidentes responden ás solicitudes rapidamente durante o horario de traballo (de luns a venres, de 6 a 17 horas (Horario do Pacífico - PST) e de 9 a 20 horas (Horario do Este - ET)) e poden iniciar sesión no teu sitio se o solicitas para axudar con problemas complexos."

#: lib/menu_support.php:34
msgid "As a Wordfence Response customer you are entitled to hands-on priority support 24 hours a day 365 days a year. Our incident response team is available out of hours to handle urgent issues and security incidents. Our customer support team is available during business hours (Monday to Friday, 6am to 5pm Pacific and 9am to 8pm Eastern time) for product assistance. Both teams can sign-in to your site to assist, on request."
msgstr "Como cliente de Wordfence Response tes dereito a un soporte práctico e prioritario as 24 horas do día os 365 días do ano. O noso equipo de resposta a incidentes está dispoñible fora do horario de atención para xestionar problemas urxentes e incidentes de seguridade. O noso equipo de atención ao cliente está dispoñible durante o horario laboral (de luns a venres, de 6 a 17 horas (Horario do Pacífico - PST) e de 9 a 20 horas (Horario do Este - ET)) para asistencia do produto. Ámbolos equipos poden acceder á túa web para axudar, se o solicitas."

