#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:1130
msgid "Wordfence lets you take control of protecting your site with powerful blocking features. Block traffic based on IP, IP range, hostname, browser, or referrer. Country blocking is available for Premium customers."
msgstr "Wordfence permíteche tomar o control da protección do teu sitio con potentes características de bloqueo. Bloquea o tráfico segundo a IP, o intervalo de IP, o hostname, o navegador ou a orixe da referencia. O bloqueo por países está dispoñible para os clientes premium."

#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:163
msgid "As a free Wordfence user, you are currently using the Community version of the Threat Defense Feed. Premium users are protected by additional firewall rules and malware signatures. Upgrade to Premium today to improve your protection."
msgstr "Como usuario gratuíto de Wordfence, estás a usar actualmente a versión Community da Threat Defense Feed. Os usuarios premium están protexidos por regras de cortalumes e sinaturas de malware adicionais. Actualiza hoxe a premium para mellorar a túa protección."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:8114
msgid "Extended Protection Mode has not been disabled. This may be because <code>auto_prepend_file</code> is configured somewhere else or the value is still cached by PHP."
msgstr "O modo de protección ampliada non se desactivou. Isto pode deberse a que <code>auto_prepend_file</code> está configurado noutro lugar ou a que PHP aínda ten o valor na caché."

#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:945
msgid "The <code>auto_prepend_file</code> setting has been successfully removed from <code>.htaccess</code> and <code>.user.ini</code>. Once this change takes effect, Extended Protection Mode will be disabled."
msgstr "O axuste <code>auto_prepend_file</code> eliminouse correctamente de <code>.htaccess</code> e <code>.user.ini</code>. Unha vez que se aplique este cambio, o modo de protección ampliada desactivarase."

