#. translators: Support URL.
#: lib/wfConfig.php:1102
msgid ""
"To preserve the integrity of your website we are not running Wordfence auto-update.\n"
"You are running the LiteSpeed web server which has been known to cause a problem with Wordfence auto-update.\n"
"Please go to your website now and make a minor change to your .htaccess to fix this.\n"
"You can find out how to make this change at:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"Alternatively you can disable auto-update on your website to stop receiving this message and upgrade Wordfence manually.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para preservar a integridade da túa web, non estamos executando a actualización automática de Wordfence.\n"
"Estás a executar o servidor web LiteSpeed, que se sabe que causa problemas coa actualización automática de Wordfence.\n"
"Vai agora á túa web e fai un pequeno cambio no teu .htaccess para arranxalo.\n"
"Podes descubrir como facer este cambio en:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"Tamén podes desactivar a actualización automática na túa web para deixar de recibir esta mensaxe e actualizar Wordfence manualmente.\n"

#. translators: 1. WP username. 2. Reset password URL. 3. Support URL.
#: lib/wfAlerts.php:265
msgid "A user with username \"%1$s\" tried to sign in to your WordPress site. Access was denied because the password being used exists on lists of passwords leaked in data breaches. Attackers use such lists to break into sites and install malicious code. Please change or reset the password (%2$s) to reactivate this account. Learn More: %3$s"
msgstr "Un usuario co nome de usuario «%1$s» tentou acceder ao teu sitio WordPress. Denegouse o acceso porque o contrasinal usado figura en listas de contrasinais filtrados en violacións de datos. Os atacantes usan estas listas para entrar en sitios e instalar código malicioso. Cambia ou restablece o contrasinal (%2$s) para reactivar esta conta. Aprende máis: %3$s"

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:6568
msgid "You may wait for the next automatic attempt or log into the parent site to manually update by clicking the \"Manually Refresh Rules\" button below the Rules list."
msgstr "Podes agardar ao seguinte intento automático ou acceder ao sitio pai para actualizar manualmente facendo clic no botón «Actualizar regras manualmente» debaixo da lista de regras."

#. translators: WordPress admin panel URL.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:6565
msgid "You may wait for the next automatic attempt at %s or log into the parent site to manually update by clicking the \"Manually Refresh Rules\" button below the Rules list."
msgstr "Podes agardar ao seguinte intento automático o %s ou acceder ao sitio pai para actualizar manualmente facendo clic no botón «Actualizar regras manualmente» debaixo da lista de regras."

#. translators: WordPress admin panel URL.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:6560
msgid "You may wait for the next automatic attempt or try to <a href=\"%s\">Manually Update</a> by clicking the \"Manually Refresh Rules\" button below the Rules list."
msgstr "Podes agardar ao seguinte intento automático ou tentar <a href=\"%s\">actualizar manualmente</a> facendo clic no botón «Actualizar regras manualmente» debaixo da lista de regras."

#. translators: 1. Localized date. 2. WordPress admin panel URL.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:6554
msgid "You may wait for the next automatic attempt at %1$s or try to <a href=\"%2$s\">Manually Update</a> by clicking the \"Manually Refresh Rules\" button below the Rules list."
msgstr "Podes agardar ao seguinte intento automático o %1$s ou tentar <a href=\"%2$s\">actualizar manualmente</a> facendo clic no botón «Actualizar regras manualmente» debaixo da lista de regras."

#. translators: Localized date.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:6546
msgid "The last rules update for the Wordfence Web Application Firewall was unsuccessful. The last successful update check was %s, so this site may be missing new rules added since then."
msgstr "A última actualización de regras do cortalumes de aplicacións web de Wordfence non se completou correctamente. A última comprobación de actualizacións correcta foi o %s, polo que a este sitio poden faltarlle as novas regras engadidas dende entón."

#. translators: File path.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:5083
msgid "You don't have permission to repair %s. You need to either fix the file manually using FTP or change the file permissions and ownership so that your web server has write access to repair the file."
msgstr "Non tes permiso para reparar %s. Tes que arranxar o arquivo manualmente mediante FTP ou cambiar os permisos e a propiedade do arquivo para que o teu servidor web teña acceso de escritura para reparalo."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:5040 lib/wordfenceClass.php:5161
msgid "Deleting an infected wp-config.php file must be done outside of Wordfence. The wp-config.php file contains your database credentials, which you will need to restore normal site operations. Your site will NOT function once the wp-config.php file has been deleted."
msgstr "A eliminación dun arquivo wp-config.php infectado debe facerse fóra de Wordfence. O arquivo wp-config.php contén as credenciais da túa base de datos, que necesitarás para restaurar o funcionamento normal do sitio. O teu sitio NON funcionará unha vez eliminado o arquivo wp-config.php."

#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:968
msgid "The scan has failed because we received an unexpected response from the Wordfence servers. This may be a temporary error, though some sites may need adjustments to run scans reliably."
msgstr "A exploración fallou porque recibimos unha resposta inesperada dos servidores de Wordfence. Pode ser un erro temporal, aínda que algúns sitios poden necesitar axustes para executar as exploracións de forma fiable."

#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:70
msgid "A scan stage has failed to start. This is often because the site either cannot make outbound requests or is blocked from connecting to itself."
msgstr "Non se puido iniciar unha fase da exploración. Isto adoita deberse a que o sitio non pode facer solicitudes saíntes ou ten bloqueada a conexión consigo mesmo."

#. translators: Localized date.
#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:952
msgid "The current scan looks like it has failed. Its last status update was more than %s ago. You may continue to wait in case it resumes or stop and restart the scan. Some sites may need adjustments to run scans reliably."
msgstr "Parece que a exploración actual fallou. A súa última actualización de estado foi hai máis de %s. Podes seguir agardando por se se retoma ou deter e reiniciar a exploración. Algúns sitios poden necesitar axustes para executar as exploracións de forma fiable."

#. translators: 1. Site URL. 2. IP address.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3904
msgid ""
"This is a test email from %1$s.\n"
"The IP address that requested this was: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"Este é un correo electrónico de proba de %1$s.\n"
"O enderezo IP que o solicitou foi: %2$s"

#. translators: WordPress username.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3227
msgid "<strong>Cellphone Sign-in Required</strong>: Cellphone Sign-in is required for all administrator accounts. Please contact the site administrator to enable it for your account."
msgstr "<strong>Acceso por teléfono móbil obrigatorio</strong>: O acceso por teléfono móbil é obrigatorio para todas as contas de administrador. Contacta co administrador do sitio para que o active na túa conta."

#. translators: 1. Reset password URL. 2. Support URL.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3218 lib/wordfenceClass.php:3254
msgid "<strong>INSECURE PASSWORD:</strong> Your login attempt has been blocked because the password you are using exists on lists of passwords leaked in data breaches. Attackers use such lists to break into sites and install malicious code. Please <a href=\"%1$s\">reset your password</a> to reactivate your account. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn More<span style=\"font-size:0;\"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>"
msgstr "<strong>CONTRASINAL INSEGURO:</strong> Bloqueouse o teu intento de acceso porque o contrasinal que usas figura en listas de contrasinais filtrados en violacións de datos. Os atacantes usan estas listas para entrar en sitios e instalar código malicioso. <a href=\"%1$s\">Restablece o teu contrasinal</a> para reactivar a túa conta. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Aprende máis<span style=\"font-size:0;\"> (ábrese nunha nova pestana)</span></a>"

#. translators: 1. Reset password URL. 2. Support URL.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3201 lib/wordfenceClass.php:3237
msgid "<strong>WARNING: </strong>Your login has been allowed because you have previously logged in from the same IP, but you will be blocked if your IP changes. The password you are using exists on lists of passwords leaked in data breaches. Attackers use such lists to break into sites and install malicious code. Please <a href=\"%1$s\">change your password</a>. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn More<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>"
msgstr "<strong>ADVERTENCIA: </strong>Permitiuse o teu acceso porque xa accediches anteriormente dende a mesma IP, pero serás bloqueado se a túa IP cambia. O contrasinal que usas figura en listas de contrasinais filtrados en violacións de datos. Os atacantes usan estas listas para entrar en sitios e instalar código malicioso. <a href=\"%1$s\">Cambia o teu contrasinal</a>. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Aprende máis<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> (ábrese nunha nova pestana)</span></a>"

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3180
msgid "<strong>CHECK YOUR PHONE</strong>: A code has been sent to your phone and will arrive within 30 seconds. Please sign in again and add a space and the code to the end of your password (e.g., <code>wfABCD</code>)."
msgstr "<strong>REVISA O TEU TELÉFONO</strong>: Enviouse un código ao teu teléfono que chegará en menos de 30 segundos. Accede de novo e engade un espazo e o código ao final do teu contrasinal (por exemplo, <code>wfABCD</code>)."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3123
msgid "<strong>CHECK YOUR PHONE</strong>: A code has been sent to your phone and will arrive within 30 seconds. Please sign in again and add a space, the letters <code>wf</code>, and the code to the end of your password (e.g., <code>wf123456</code>)."
msgstr "<strong>REVISA O TEU TELÉFONO</strong>: Enviouse un código ao teu teléfono que chegará en menos de 30 segundos. Accede de novo e engade un espazo, as letras <code>wf</code> e o código ao final do teu contrasinal (por exemplo, <code>wf123456</code>)."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3084
msgid "<strong>CODE REQUIRED</strong>: Please check your authenticator app for the current code. Please sign in again and add a space, the letters <code>wf</code>, and the code to the end of your password (e.g., <code>wf123456</code>)."
msgstr "<strong>CÓDIGO NECESARIO</strong>: Consulta o código actual na túa aplicación de autenticación. Accede de novo e engade un espazo, as letras <code>wf</code> e o código ao final do teu contrasinal (por exemplo, <code>wf123456</code>)."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3028
msgid "<strong>INVALID CODE</strong>: You need to enter your password and the code we sent to your phone. The code should start with 'wf' and should be four characters (e.g., wfAB12)."
msgstr "<strong>CÓDIGO NON VÁLIDO</strong>: Tes que introducir o teu contrasinal e o código que enviamos ao teu teléfono. O código debería comezar por «wf» e ter catro caracteres (por exemplo, wfAB12)."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3005
msgid "<strong>CODE EXPIRED. CHECK YOUR PHONE:</strong> The code you entered has expired. Codes are only valid for 30 minutes for security reasons. We have sent you a new code. Please sign in using your username, password, and the new code we sent you."
msgstr "<strong>O CÓDIGO CADUCOU. REVISA O TEU TELÉFONO:</strong> O código que introduciches caducou. Por motivos de seguridade, os códigos só son válidos durante 30 minutos. Enviámosche un novo código. Accede co teu nome de usuario, o teu contrasinal e o novo código que che enviamos."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:2959
msgid "<strong>INVALID CODE</strong>: You need to enter the code generated sent to your phone. The code should be a six digit number (e.g., 123456)."
msgstr "<strong>CÓDIGO NON VÁLIDO</strong>: Tes que introducir o código xerado que se enviou ao teu teléfono. O código debería ser un número de seis díxitos (por exemplo, 123456)."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:2955
msgid "<strong>INVALID CODE</strong>: You need to enter the code generated by your authenticator app. The code should be a six digit number (e.g., 123456)."
msgstr "<strong>CÓDIGO NON VÁLIDO</strong>: Tes que introducir o código xerado pola túa aplicación de autenticación. O código debería ser un número de seis díxitos (por exemplo, 123456)."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:2938
msgid "<strong>INVALID CODE</strong>: Please sign in again and add a space, the letters <code>wf</code>, and the code sent to your phone to the end of your password (e.g., <code>wf123456</code>)."
msgstr "<strong>CÓDIGO NON VÁLIDO</strong>: Accede de novo e engade un espazo, as letras <code>wf</code> e o código enviado ao teu teléfono ao final do teu contrasinal (por exemplo, <code>wf123456</code>)."

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:2934
msgid "<strong>INVALID CODE</strong>: Please sign in again and add a space, the letters <code>wf</code>, and the code from your authenticator app to the end of your password (e.g., <code>wf123456</code>)."
msgstr "<strong>CÓDIGO NON VÁLIDO</strong>: Accede de novo e engade un espazo, as letras <code>wf</code> e o código da túa aplicación de autenticación ao final do teu contrasinal (por exemplo, <code>wf123456</code>)."

#. translators: 1. WordPress admin panel URL. 2. Support URL.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:2910 lib/wordfenceClass.php:3046
msgid "<strong>WARNING: </strong>The password you are using exists on lists of passwords leaked in data breaches. Attackers use such lists to break into sites and install malicious code. Please <a href=\"%1$s\">change your password</a>. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn More<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>"
msgstr "<strong>ADVERTENCIA: </strong>O contrasinal que usas figura en listas de contrasinais filtrados en violacións de datos. Os atacantes usan estas listas para entrar en sitios e instalar código malicioso. <a href=\"%1$s\">Cambia o teu contrasinal</a>. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Aprende máis<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> (ábrese nunha nova pestana)</span></a>"

#. translators: 1. WordPress username. 2. Password reset URL.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:2891 lib/wordfenceClass.php:3452
msgid "<strong>ERROR</strong>: The username or password you entered is incorrect. <a href=\"%2$s\" title=\"Password Lost and Found\">Lost your password</a>?"
msgstr "<strong>ERRO</strong>: O nome de usuario ou o contrasinal que introduciches non é correcto. <a href=\"%2$s\" title=\"Password Lost and Found\">Esqueciches o teu contrasinal</a>?"

#. translators: Email address.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:2048
msgid "We received a request to email \"%s\" instructions to unlock their access. If that is the email address of a site administrator or someone on the Wordfence alert list, they have been emailed instructions on how to regain access to this system. The instructions we sent will expire 30 minutes from now."
msgstr "Recibimos unha solicitude para enviar por correo electrónico a «%s» instrucións para desbloquear o seu acceso. Se ese é o enderezo de correo electrónico dun administrador do sitio ou de alguén da lista de alertas de Wordfence, enviáronselle instrucións sobre como recuperar o acceso a este sistema. As instrucións que enviamos caducarán dentro de 30 minutos."

#. translators: Support URL.
#: lib/wfCredentialsController.php:311
msgid "Please choose a different password. The password you are using exists on lists of passwords leaked in data breaches. Attackers use such lists to break into sites and install malicious code. <a href=\"%s\">Learn More</a>"
msgstr "Elixe un contrasinal diferente. O contrasinal que usas figura en listas de contrasinais filtrados en violacións de datos. Os atacantes usan estas listas para entrar en sitios e instalar código malicioso. <a href=\"%s\">Aprende máis</a>"

#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:219
msgid "By default, Wordfence will scan your site daily. Start your first scan now to see if your site has any security issues that need to be addressed. From here you can run manual scans any time you like."
msgstr "Por defecto, Wordfence explorará o teu sitio a diario. Inicia agora a túa primeira exploración para ver se o teu sitio ten algún problema de seguridade que deba resolverse. Dende aquí podes executar exploracións manuais cando queiras."

#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:75
msgid "A Wordfence scan looks for malware, malicious URLs, and patterns of infections by examining all of the files, posts, and comments on your WordPress website. It also checks your server and monitors your site's online reputation."
msgstr "Unha exploración de Wordfence busca malware, URL maliciosas e padróns de infección examinando todos os arquivos, entradas e comentarios da túa web WordPress. Tamén comproba o teu servidor e supervisa a reputación en liña do teu sitio."

#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:335
msgid "Do not repair files on your system unless you're ABSOLUTELY sure you know what you're doing. If you repair the wrong file it could cause your WordPress website to stop functioning and you will probably have to restore from backups. If you're unsure, Cancel and work with your hosting provider to clean your system of infected files."
msgstr "Non repares arquivos do teu sistema a menos que esteas ABSOLUTAMENTE seguro de que sabes o que fas. Se reparas o arquivo incorrecto, a túa web WordPress podería deixar de funcionar e probablemente terás que restaurala dende copias de seguridade. Se non estás seguro, fai clic en Cancelar e traballa co teu provedor de aloxamento para limpar o teu sistema de arquivos infectados."

#. translators: support URL
#: lib/wfJavascriptBridge.php:509
msgid "If you delete the wrong file, it could cause your WordPress website to stop functioning, and you will probably have to restore from a backup."
msgstr "Se eliminas o arquivo incorrecto, a túa web WordPress podería deixar de funcionar e probablemente terás que restaurala dende unha copia de seguridade."

#: lib/wf503.php:385 lib/wfLockedOut.php:394
msgid "Wordfence is a security plugin installed on over 5 million WordPress sites. The owner of this site is using Wordfence to manage access to their site."
msgstr "Wordfence é un plugin de seguridade instalado en máis de 5 millóns de sitios WordPress. O propietario deste sitio usa Wordfence para xestionar o acceso ao seu sitio."

#: lib/menu_tools_whois.php:23
msgid "The whois service gives you a way to look up who owns an IP address or domain name that is visiting your website or is engaging in malicious activity on your website."
msgstr "O servizo whois ofrécete unha forma de consultar quen é o propietario dun enderezo IP ou nome de dominio que está a visitar a túa web ou que está a realizar actividade maliciosa na túa web."

#. translators: URL to the WordPress admin panel.
#: lib/email_genericAlert.php:34
msgid ""
"To see current Wordfence alerts, visit:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Para ver as alertas actuais de Wordfence, visita:\n"
"%s"

#. translators: URL to the WordPress admin panel.
#: lib/email_genericAlert.php:30
msgid ""
"To change your alert options for Wordfence, visit:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Para cambiar as túas opcións de alertas de Wordfence, visita:\n"
"%s"

#: lib/email_genericAlert.php:14
msgid ""
"NOTE: You are using the free version of Wordfence. Upgrade today:\n"
" - Receive real-time Firewall and Scan engine rule updates for protection as threats emerge\n"
" - Real-time IP Blocklist blocks the most malicious IPs from accessing your site\n"
" - Country blocking\n"
" - IP reputation monitoring\n"
" - Schedule scans to run more frequently and at optimal times\n"
" - Access to Premium Support\n"
" - Discounts for multi-year and multi-license purchases\n"
"\n"
"Click here to upgrade to Wordfence Premium:\n"
"https://www.wordfence.com/zz1/wordfence-signup/"
msgstr ""
"NOTA: Estás a usar a versión gratuíta de Wordfence. Actualiza hoxe:\n"
" - Recibe actualizacións en tempo real das regras do cortalumes e do motor de exploración para protexerte a medida que xurdan ameazas\n"
